[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 360.95, "timestamp": "00:06:00", "text": "但积分系统才是关键所在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 365.27, "timestamp": "00:06:05", "text": "痛苦，没有人感到困惑，他们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 368.83, "timestamp": "00:06:08", "text": "来自该小部件未安装的平台"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 374.43, "timestamp": "00:06:14", "text": "像YouTube之类的网站那样统计。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 377.71, "timestamp": "00:06:17", "text": "所以，很多事，又不很多事。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 382.782, "timestamp": "00:06:22", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "T~T"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 393.749, "timestamp": "00:06:33", "text": "不。但如果让我再做一次，我会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 395.99, "timestamp": "00:06:35", "text": "实际上会投入更多的时间和精力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 406.79, "timestamp": "00:06:46", "text": "因为我对这次活动的举办方式很不满意。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 408.87, "timestamp": "00:06:48", "text": "我一切都安排妥当了。我的意思是，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 411.67, "timestamp": "00:06:51", "text": "其中一位帮了大忙。这一切都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 414.27, "timestamp": "00:06:54", "text": "独自一人。而且我当时"}]